  aciklama:
  - "De\u011Ferli {{isim}}, seni d\xFC\u015F\xFCnerek g\xF6zlerimi kapat\u0131p gelece\u011Fine
    odakland\u0131\u011F\u0131mda, \xF6n\xFCmde bir c\u0131mb\u0131z fig\xFCr\xFC
    belirdi. \u0130mge kaybolduktan sonra ise arkas\u0131ndan sen \xE7\u0131kt\u0131n.
    Oldu\u011Fun yerde d\xF6nerek adeta bir \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F ar\u0131yorsun.
    Bu c\u0131mb\u0131z, senin son g\xFCnlerde do\u011Fruyu yanl\u0131\u015Ftan ay\u0131rmaya
    ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, elem ve kederi bu sayede hayat\u0131ndan
    \xE7\u0131karaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret ediyor. Sana gam ve tasa veren
    ve ge\xE7mi\u015Ften bug\xFCne ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131n her ne ise,
    gelecekte senden ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015F olacak."
